  "evaluation": {
    "primary_metric": "accuracy",
    "harbor_aligned_metric": "accuracy (pass@1). A Harbor adapter was merged at harbor-framework/harbor#1397 on 2026-04-22 and lives at adapters/aa-lcr/. It evaluates 99 of 100 tasks (task 2 excluded for an unfixable ground-truth error; tasks 40 and 94 ship with corrected answers) and uses GPT-5-mini as the LLM equality judge rather than AA's Qwen3-235B-A22B 2507 Non-Reasoning. parity_experiment.json records four 1-run parity configurations: codex@0.117.0+gpt-5-mini = 0.687 (vs AA-direct gpt-5-mini high 0.680), claude-code@2.1.104+claude-haiku-4-5 = 0.626 (vs AA-direct claude-haiku-4-5 non-reasoning 0.437), terminus-2@2.0.0+gpt-5-mini = 0.323, terminus-2@2.0.0+claude-haiku-4-5 = 0.495. Harbor scores are NOT directly comparable against the AA leaderboard - different judge, different harness - and the adapter README states its purpose is to validate the adapter across agent+model combinations, not to reproduce AA's ranking."
  },
